# Market domain

This is the domain rule (the role `gold-domain` plays in ZARVA). Subject is Tehran equities and IPO sniping, not karat or jewelry invoices.

- Money is Rial in the engine. Show Toman only as a display conversion (`amount / 10`), labeled. Never mix the two in one stored field
- Prices and quantities are integers. Do not invent a last trade, NAV, or queue position without `tsetmc` / the broker response
- Fees and breakeven go through `@saf-shekan/core` fee calculator. Do not reimplement buy/sell commission in the UI
- Timing uses `SniperTimingConfig`: `targetTime`, `leadTimeMs`, `burstCount`, `burstIntervalMs`, pre-warm. Clock offset comes from time-sync, not `Date.now()` guesses in the UI
- `antiDoubleSpend` and `stopOnFirstSuccess` are safety switches. Do not fire a second logical order after a confirmed fill
- Engine states are only `IDLE | ARMED | PRE_WARMING | FIRING | COMPLETED | CANCELLED | ERROR`
- Broker presets stay in the backend broker module. A new broker needs a preset plus DTO validation, not a one-off fetch in a component
